The '''Wizard''' is an [[NPC]] who lives on the top floor of the {{zone|Wizard Tower}}. They claim to be fixing [[Wizard Tower#The Wizard Portal|The Wizard Portal]], and is replaced with the '''Wizard's Assistant''' after completing the [[Rift Dimension]], who functions identically.

