== Trivia ==
*The Wizard is referenced in [[Tal Ker]]'s dialogue ("The other day I met some kind of wizard and they told me to come back in 3 to 5 business days. That was over a year ago, still nothing. What kind of people do that? Tells you to come back in a few days for no reason. Really makes you think.")<!--Editor's Note: Punctuation added for readability-->
*During Year 189, the name of the Wizard would sometimes show as obfuscated text of 6 letters.<!--
*Wizard is the only NPC that acknowledges events without being an event NPC himself.
**Reacting to an event might be a reference to Terraria where most NPCs react to various events that happen.-->

